                                                        <p class="brfprofile">
                                                            <b>Brief Profile:</b><br />

                                                            Dr. Swati Raj is an experienced academician and researcher
                                                            in the field of Statistics and Operations Research, with
                                                            over 12 years of teaching experience in reputed
                                                            institutions. She is currently working as an Associate
                                                            Professor at
                                                            GNIOT Institute of Management Studies (GIMS), Greater Noida,
                                                            and previously served as an Associate Professor at G.L.
                                                            Bajaj, IILM Greater Noida, and Banasthali University.<br />
                                                            She holds a Ph.D. from Banasthali University, Rajasthan,
                                                            along with M.Sc. and B.Sc. degrees in Statistics. Her
                                                            teaching expertise includes Business Statistics, Operations
                                                            Research, Research Methodology, SPSS, Clinical Trials,
                                                            and Quantitative Techniques at both undergraduate and
                                                            postgraduate levels.<br />
                                                            Dr. Raj has published numerous research papers, book
                                                            chapters, and conference papers in national and
                                                            international
                                                            journals. Her research interests extend to statistical
                                                            design theory, AI applications, fintech, supply chain
                                                            analytics, digital marketing, and education technology. She
                                                            is a DST-JRF qualified scholar, NPTEL certified, and
                                                            actively participates in FDPs, seminars, and international
                                                            conferences.<br />
                                                            She is committed to academic excellence, research
                                                            innovation, student mentorship, and continuous professional
                                                            development.
                                                        </p>


