                                                    <div id="Button4" class="tabcontent">
                                                        <p class="factitle">Teaching Innovation</p>
                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            I believe that effective teaching is not about delivering
                                                            information but about ensuring that students understand,
                                                            apply, and retain concepts in a meaningful way. My teaching
                                                            philosophy is centered on creating an interactive,
                                                            inclusive, and student-friendly learning environment where
                                                            every student feels encouraged to participate and
                                                            contribute.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            One of the key aspects of my teaching approach is making
                                                            classes highly interactive. Rather than relying solely on
                                                            one-way lectures, I actively engage students through
                                                            discussions, real-life examples, case studies,
                                                            problem-solving activities, and classroom interactions. I
                                                            encourage students to ask questions freely and share their
                                                            perspectives, making the classroom a collaborative learning
                                                            space rather than a passive listening environment.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            A major focus of my teaching is supporting students who may
                                                            hesitate to participate or struggle with understanding
                                                            concepts. I consciously identify such students and create
                                                            opportunities for them to engage in discussions without fear
                                                            of judgment. Through continuous encouragement, personalized
                                                            guidance, and positive reinforcement, I help them build
                                                            confidence and gradually become active contributors in the
                                                            classroom. I strongly believe that every student has
                                                            potential, and often a little encouragement can make a
                                                            significant difference in their learning journey.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            In both Operations Management and AI &amp; Business
                                                            Analytics courses, I emphasize conceptual understanding
                                                            rather than rote memorization. Instead of asking students to
                                                            simply remember theories, formulas or definitions, I focus
                                                            on helping them understand the logic behind concepts and
                                                            their practical applications. By connecting classroom topics
                                                            to real-world business situations, industry practices, and
                                                            everyday experiences, students are able to appreciate the
                                                            relevance of what they learn and apply their knowledge more
                                                            effectively.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            To make learning more engaging, I frequently use examples
                                                            from current business scenarios, emerging technologies, and
                                                            industry trends. Students are encouraged to analyse
                                                            problems, evaluate alternatives, and suggest solutions. This
                                                            approach not only improves their understanding of the
                                                            subject but also develops critical thinking, analytical
                                                            reasoning, and decision-making skills.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            Technology also plays an important role in my teaching. I
                                                            incorporate digital resources, AI tools, presentations,
                                                            videos, and interactive learning platforms to enhance
                                                            student engagement. Particularly in AI and Business
                                                            Analytics courses, students are introduced to emerging
                                                            technologies and encouraged to explore how data-driven
                                                            decision-making is transforming organizations. These
                                                            discussions help bridge the gap between academic learning
                                                            and industry expectations.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            I also believe in continuous learning and feedback. Regular
                                                            classroom interactions, quizzes, presentations and
                                                            discussions allow me to assess student understanding and
                                                            address learning gaps promptly. Constructive feedback helps
                                                            students improve while also enabling me to adapt my teaching
                                                            methods according to their needs.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            Beyond academics, I strive to create a supportive and
                                                            motivating learning environment where students feel
                                                            comfortable expressing themselves. My objective is not only
                                                            to help students achieve academic success but also to
                                                            develop their confidence, communication skills,
                                                            problem-solving abilities, and readiness for professional
                                                            challenges.
                                                        </p>

                                                        <p class="facpara">
                                                            Through interactive teaching, personalized attention, and a
                                                            strong emphasis on conceptual clarity, I aim to make
                                                            learning meaningful, enjoyable, and impactful. My ultimate
                                                            goal is to nurture curious learners and future professionals
                                                            who can think independently, solve real-world problems and
                                                            continue learning throughout their careers.
                                                        </p>
